cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PMSM DTC/SVM-DTC Winder Simulation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "PMSM DTC/SVM-DTC Winder Simulation contributors"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB/Simulink study of classical hysteresis Direct Torque Control (DTC)
  and Space-Vector-Modulated DTC (SVM-DTC) for a surface-mounted permanent
  magnet synchronous motor (PMSM) driving a winder/unwinder. The repository
  includes motor and drive models, a voltage-model flux/torque estimator,
  stator-resistance robustness studies, a variable-radius and variable-inertia
  winder plant, tension PI control, radius/inertia/tension feedforward, an
  S-curve line reference, and an 18-case final comparison matrix.
keywords:
  - PMSM
  - direct torque control
  - DTC
  - SVM-DTC
  - winder
  - unwinder
  - tension control
  - Simulink
  - Simscape
  - motor drives
